Same as `BankConnection/index.tsx`: the `isRefreshConnectionFlow` boolean flag is redundant. Its header title effect (line 70) is dead code when `feed` is provided, and the `useEffect` branching can rely on `onRefreshComplete` alone.

Remove `isRefreshConnectionFlow` and check `onRefreshComplete` directly:
```tsx
if (onRefreshComplete) {
    if (isFeedConnectionBroken) {
        updateBrokenConnection();
    }
    onRefreshComplete();
    return;
}
```
Also remove the dead-code ternary in `headerTitleAddCards` at line 70.

