The `Badge` component has a built-in `success` prop that internally calls `StyleUtils.getBadgeColorStyle(success, error, pressed, ...)` to determine the correct badge color. Manually passing `isDomainVerified && styles.badgeSuccess` via `badgeStyles` bypasses this API and duplicates the styling logic. Use Badge's native `success` prop instead:

```tsx
<Badge
    text={badgeText}
    success={isDomainVerified}
    textStyles={styles.textStrong}
    badgeStyles={[styles.alignSelfCenter, styles.badgeBordered]}
/>
```

